15
00:01:08,864 --> 00:01:13,039
When the response itself is part of your evidence, register the response waiter before

16
00:01:13,052 --> 00:01:19,139
clicking. Match both the HTTP method and the pathname, so an unrelated request cannot

17
00:01:19,152 --> 00:01:25,289
satisfy the waiter. Keep the response promise and await it after the click. This order

18
00:01:25,302 --> 00:01:30,176
avoids missing a fast response from a local server. The displayed predicate is

19
00:01:30,189 --> 00:01:35,327
deliberately narrow. If your gateway adds another relevant request, inspect the

20
00:01:35,339 --> 00:01:39,052
network evidence and update the predicate from that observation rather than

21
00:01:39,064 --> 00:01:41,452
introducing a general wait for all traffic.

22
00:01:43,666 --> 00:01:47,816
After submission, assert the exact confirmation and the visible balance using

23
00:01:47,828 --> 00:01:53,091
Playwright's locator assertions. These assertions wait for the relevant UI condition

24
00:01:53,104 --> 00:01:58,041
instead of taking a single immediate text snapshot. They do not remove the need to

25
00:01:58,054 --> 00:02:03,029
understand your application's consistency guarantees. The balance is an immediate

26
00:02:03,041 --> 00:02:08,516
account observation in this lab, so nine hundred pesos is the expected result. A

27
00:02:08,529 --> 00:02:13,354
confirmation message alone is weaker: it could appear even if the amount, account, or

28
00:02:13,366 --> 00:02:16,028
number of debits were wrong underneath the interface.

29
00:02:18,252 --> 00:02:23,390
Query the source account through the page's associated request context. It shares the

30
00:02:23,402 --> 00:02:27,515
browser session, so the query represents the same authenticated identity that

31
00:02:27,527 --> 00:02:33,577
submitted the transfer. Assert the HTTP status before interpreting the JSON body.

32
00:02:34,440 --> 00:02:39,690
Then compare the integer balance with ninety thousand centavos. If the request fails

33
00:02:39,702 --> 00:02:44,227
with an authorization response, diagnose authentication or ownership instead of

34
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:49,440
reporting a wrong balance. Also retain the account identifier with your evidence so a

35
00:02:49,452 --> 00:02:53,440
