43
00:03:32,344 --> 00:03:36,944
Create a fresh fixture for the insufficient funds case and fill eleven hundred pesos.

44
00:03:37,807 --> 00:03:42,444
Register the same targeted response waiter, click once, and verify the rejection

45
00:03:42,457 --> 00:03:48,719
status and business error code. Assert the exact alert in the browser. Then query the

46
00:03:48,732 --> 00:03:52,794
